WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.697
CASE and FILTER are two styles for conditional
aggregation CASE is

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:11.211
broadly portable and flexible FILTER is particularly
readable

00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:17.052
in PostgreSQL when you want category-specific counts
or sums Choose

00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:22.660
the form that is clear for the environment you are
using The output grain and

00:00:22.686 --> 00:00:25.607
aggregate meaning matter more than the stylistic
choice
